#before peer lock-on
# Security mode turned on by alice's other device (the owner's first, e2e/peer.ts): this phone, left out, waits to be
# approved. It sends the request; the other device, online, shows a code for it; the code typed here, as a person reads
# it off the other device and types it, approves it: Home comes back, and the test station's lock has this phone as
# one of alice's own app devices.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 等待批准此设备
shot 1-waiting
log do: peer-bg lock-await 120
log do: peer-said AWAITING
done 2-peer-said
tap 发送批准请求
until 输入你的受信任设备上显示的安全码
shot 2-code
log do: peer-said PAIRING
typedone 3-peer-said
until 端到端测试
shot 3-home
log do: peer-wait
done 4-peer-wait
